flowchart TD
    subgraph UI[Qt UI executable - GUI thread]
        Provider[QtGraphicsContextProvider]
        Viewport[OpenGLViewportWidget: displays ScreenFrame pixels]
        Adapter[QTSceneInspector]
    end

    subgraph Engine[engine DLL]
        Facade[Engine facade: Start / Stop / screens / input / services]
        subgraph EngineThread[Engine thread - EngineRuntime, GL thread]
            InputQueue[InputEventQueue drain]
            Scene[Scene / DtiVolumeScene Update]
            Snapshot[SceneSnapshot: typed render commands]
            Extraction[ExtractionRegistry]
            Builder[RenderFrameBuilder]
            Readback[Readback + publish ScreenFrame, callbacks - no lock held]
        end
        Locked[LockedInspectionService / LockedSettingsService - sceneMutex]
        Resources[Model, Volume and concrete geometry resources]
        Inspect[InspectProvider and InspectField]
    end

    subgraph Worker[Preprocessing worker - BackgroundTask]
        Pipeline[MriToDtiPreprocessor / dataset read-write]
        Pack[PackDTIVolumeTextures: TextureData3D]
    end

    subgraph Render[engine_render static lib - engine/render]
        Init[InitializeGraphicsApi / CollectGraphicsGarbage / ShutdownGraphicsApi]
        Frame[RenderFrame and RenderDataStore]
        Passes[Insertion-ordered render pass vector via RenderBackend]
        Renderer[Renderer / ForwardRenderer]
        Target[RenderTarget per screen]
        GpuResources[Shader, Material, Texture, Geometry, InstanceBuffer - lazy upload]
    end

    Viewport --> Facade
    Provider -. context on engine thread .-> Facade
    Facade --> Init
    Viewport -. queued input .-> InputQueue
    InputQueue --> Scene
    Scene -. starts / polls jobs .-> Pipeline
    Pipeline --> Pack
    Pack -. job outcome .-> Scene
    Scene --> Resources
    Resources --> GpuResources
    Scene --> Inspect
    Scene --> Snapshot
    Snapshot --> Builder
    Extraction --> Builder
    Builder --> Frame
    Passes --> Renderer
    Frame --> Renderer
    Renderer --> Target
    Target --> Readback
    Readback -. OnFrameReady, GetScreenFrame .-> Viewport
    Inspect --> Locked
    Locked --> Adapter
    Adapter -. field edits .-> Locked

    Passes --> GpuResources
    Assets[(engine/assets and engine/shaders)] --> Resources
    Assets --> GpuResources
